{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33710","headline":"雪诗 · 张孜","name":"雪诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安大雪天，鸟雀难相觅。\n其中豪贵家，捣椒泥四壁。\n到处爇红炉，周回下罗幂。\n暖手调金丝，蘸甲斟琼液。\n醉唱玉尘飞，困融香汗滴。\n岂知饥寒人，手脚生皴劈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张孜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33710.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33710","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}